      "content": "Header Layout"
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": "Since the logo and navigation links are aligned in a straight line, you can use a flexbox to align them."
    },
    {
      "type": "code",
      "language": "html",
      "content": "1<header class=\"header\">\n2    <div class=\"logo\">Jane</div>\n3    <nav class=\"nav\">\n4        <a href=\"#projects\">Projects</a>\n5        <a href=\"#contact\">Contact</a>\n6    </nav>\n7</header>"
    },
    {
      "type": "code",
      "language": "css",
      "content": "1.header {\n2    display: flex;\n3    padding: 10px min(5vw, 300px);\n4    justify-content: space-between;\n5    align-items: center;\n6}"
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": "In the above code,"
    },
    {
      "type": "bullet_list",
      "items": [
        "display: flex enables flexbox on the header, allowing easy alignment of its child elements.",
        "justify-content: space-between places the logo on the left and navigation links on the right by spacing them out evenly.",
        "align-items: center centers items vertically in the header."
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": "Let's style the logo and navigation links to make the header look more polished."
    },
